OL,3,GNEWSASchools across Scotland targeted
OL,4,Awith fresh hoax bomb threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools across Scotland have been
OL,7,Ftargeted with a fresh wave of hoax bomb
OL,8,Fthreats, less than a month after a
OL,9,Fprevious alert.
OL,11,FThe force said at least 470 schools had
OL,12,Freceived the email but that the
OL,13,Fwarnings were "immediately assessed" as
OL,14,Fhoaxes and there was nothing to suggest
OL,15,Fa credible threat.
OL,17,FSpecialist cyber crime officers are
OL,18,Fworking to identify the source of the
OL,19,Fmessages, which were sent to both
OL,20,Fprimary and secondary schools.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
